CHIP MATRIX MACH111
PIN 10 A
PIN 32 B
PIN 14 C
PIN 15 D
PIN 16 E
PIN 17 F
PIN 11 CLK
PIN 2 Q0 REG
PIN 3 Q1 REG
PIN 4 Q2 REG
PIN 5 Q3 
EQUATIONS
Q0=A*/C+/A*/D+/A*B*C*/D+/A*/C*/D*/E+/B*/C*/D+/A*C*D*F+A*/B*/C*/D
Q0.CLKF=CLK
Q1.T=/B*C*/D*/E+B*/E*F+B*/C*D*E+B*/C*/E*F+A*/B*/C*F+/A*/E+/A*/B*/C*/F
Q1.CLKF=CLK
Q2=(/D*E+/A*B+C*D*/E+/B*/E*F+A*/D*/E*/F+A*/C*/E*F+/A*/D*F) :+: F
Q2.CLKF=CLK
Q3=B*/E*/F+/C*E*F+D*F+A*C*F+/C*D*/E*/F+/A*B*/D+/A*/C*/D*F
